ide a form without type will submit it","Button is for scripts; reset restores initial values and easily wipes the input","A button label names the action instead of saying \"OK\""],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":95.0,"y":60.0,"w":150.0,"h":40.0,"text":"<div onclick>\nno focus, no role","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"bt","x":265.0,"y":60.0,"w":150.0,"h":40.0,"text":"<button>\nfocus, Space, Enter","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":118.0,"text":"the screen reader announces the role \"button\"","size":9.5}],[{"t":"zone","id":"f","x":130.0,"y":88.0,"w":200.0,"h":96.0,"tone":"outline","label":"form"},{"t":"cell","id":"b1","x":130.0,"y":62.0,"w":160.0,"h":26.0,"text":"<button>Clear</button>","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":130.0,"y1":78.0,"x2":130.0,"y2":96.0,"tone":"red","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"sub","x":130.0,"y":110.0,"w":130.0,"h":24.0,"text":"form submitted!","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n1","x":300.0,"y":66.0,"text":"type=submit","size":9.5},{"t":"text","id":"n2","x":300.0,"y":82.0,"text":"by default","size":9.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":60.0,"y":60.0,"w":92.0,"h":38.0,"text":"type=submit\nsubmits","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"bu","x":180.0,"y":60.0,"w":92.0,"h":38.0,"text":"type=button\nfor scripts","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"r","x":300.0,"y":60.0,"w":92.0,"h":38.0,"text":"type=reset\nresets","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":118.0,"text":"reset wipes all input in one press","size":9.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"o1","x":95.0,"y":58.0,"w":130.0,"h":32.0,"text":"\"OK\"","tone":"red","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"o2","x":265.0,"y":58.0,"w":130.0,"h":32.0,"text":"\"Place order\"","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":112.0,"text":"the label names the action","size":9.5}]],"cues":[16.8,26.1,38.9]}]},{"title":"Grouping","sub":"fieldset and legend","main":"A group of fields is a fieldset with a legend; radio buttons in a group share one name.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Group","Context","Shared name","Keyboard"],"captions":["Related fields are gathered by fieldset, and the group heading goes in legend","A screen reader first reads the group question, then the option; without legend \"By courier\" hangs in the air","Radios in a group share one name, values differ; checked marks the default option","You tab into a group once and switch inside with arrows; disabled on a fieldset greys out all fields"],"frames":[[{"t":"zone","id":"z","x":180.0,"y":88.0,"w":220.0,"h":100.0,"tone":"outline","label":"fieldset · legend: Delivery"},{"t":"cell","id":"r1","x":180.0,"y":64.0,"w":170.0,"h":26.0,"text":"( ) by mail","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"r2","x":180.0,"y":104.0,"w":170.0,"h":26.0,"text":"(•) by courier","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"s1","x":180.0,"y":45.0,"w":320.0,"h":32.0,"text":"with legend: \"Delivery, group. By courier, 2 of 2\"","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"s2","x":180.0,"y":95.0,"w":320.0,"h":32.0,"text":"without legend: \"By courier, radio button\"","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":142.0,"text":"the group question is read before the option","size":9.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"code","x":30.0,"y":26.0,"lines":["<input type=\"radio\" name=\"d\" value=\"post\">","<input type=\"radio\" name=\"d\" value=\"courier\" checked>"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"html","size":9.0,"lh":16.0,"w":320.0},{"t":"text","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"text":"shared name: only one option can be chosen","size":9.5},{"t":"text","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":114.0,"text":"checked: selected by default","size":9.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"tab","x":50.0,"y":62.0,"w":60.0,"h":30.0,"text":"Tab","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":82.0,"y1":62.0,"x2":130.0,"y2":62.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"zone","id":"z2","x":220.0,"y":66.0,"w":170.0,"h":70.0,"tone":"outline","label":"group: one tab stop"},{"t":"cell","id":"c1","x":170.0,"y":66.0,"w":40.0,"h":26.0,"text":"( )","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c2","x":220.0,"y":66.0,"w":40.0,"h":26.0,"text":"(•)","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c3","x":270.0,"y":66.0,"w":40.0,"h":26.0,"text":"( )","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n1","x":220.0,"y":116.0,"text":"arrows switch the options","size":9.5},{"t":"text","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":142.0,"text":"disabled on fieldset greys out all fields inside","size":9.5}]],"cues":[5.6,17.8,25.4]}]},{"title":"Built-in validation","sub":"required, pattern, min and max","main":"The browser validates a form without scripts, but browser validation is a convenience, not protection.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Attributes","Rules","Submitting","Not protection"],"captions":["The browser validates a form without scripts: a few attributes are enough","Required, email shape, length, number and date limits, a regular expression for a code","Validation fails: the form is not sent, focus goes to the problem field, a bubble explains why","But it is a convenience, not protection: a request is easy to forge, so the server checks everything again"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"code","x":20.0,"y":28.0,"lines":["<input type=\"email\" required>","<input name=\"pin\" pattern=\"[0-9]{6}\">","<input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\">","<input name=\"nick\" minlength=\"3\">"],"lang":"html","size":9.5,"lh":17.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a0","x":90.0,"y":22.0,"w":150.0,"h":22.0,"text":"required","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"r0","x":265.0,"y":22.0,"w":170.0,"h":22.0,"text":"not empty","tone":"green","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a1","x":90.0,"y":50.0,"w":150.0,"h":22.0,"text":"type=\"email\"","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"r1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":170.0,"h":22.0,"text":"something@something","tone":"green","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a2","x":90.0,"y":78.0,"w":150.0,"h":22.0,"text":"minlength","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"r2","x":265.0,"y":78.0,"w":170.0,"h":22.0,"text":"at least N characters","tone":"green","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a3","x":90.0,"y":106.0,"w":150.0,"h":22.0,"text":"min / max","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"r3","x":265.0,"y":106.0,"w":170.0,"h":22.0,"text":"number or date in range","tone":"green","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a4","x":90.0,"y":134.0,"w":150.0,"h":22.0,"text":"pattern","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"r4","x":265.0,"y":134.0,"w":170.0,"h":22.0,"text":"pattern: 6 digits","tone":"green","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"sb","x":70.0,"y":60.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"Submit","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":122.0,"y1":60.0,"x2":168.0,"y2":60.0,"tone":"red","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"st","x":255.0,"y":60.0,"w":160.0,"h":42.0,"text":"stop: focus on the field\nand an explanation bubble","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":125.0,"text":"the request did not reach the server","size":9.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"br","x":95.0,"y":55.0,"w":140.0,"h":38.0,"text":"browser\nconvenience","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"sv","x":265.0,"y":55.0,"w":140.0,"h":38.0,"text":"server\nprotection","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":168.0,"y1":55.0,"x2":192.0,"y2":55.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":110.0,"text":"a request can be forged: the server checks again","size":9.5},{"t":"text","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":135.0,"text":"novalidate turns off browser validation","size":9.0}]],"cues":[10.0,20.0,35.2]}]},{"title":"Autofill and states","sub":"autocomplete, inputmode, disabled and readonly","main":"disabled is not sent, readonly is sent; :user-invalid turns red only after input.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["autocomplete","inputmode","disabled and readonly","Pseudo-classes"],"captions":["Autocomplete tells the browser and password manager what the field asks for","Inputmode changes only the keyboard: the field stays text, with digits at hand","Disabled turns the field off, readonly keeps it visible and submitted but not editable","Invalid turns red at once, user-invalid only after the person has typed something"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"code","x":24.0,"y":28.0,"lines":["<input autocomplete=\"email\">","<input autocomplete=\"one-time-code\">","<input autocomplete=\"current-password\">","<input autocomplete=\"new-password\">"],"hl":[2],"lang":"html","size":9.5,"lh":17.0,"w":320.0},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":128.0,"text":"the browser and password manager know what to fill in","size":9.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"i","x":80.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":28.0,"text":"inputmode=numeric","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":146.0,"y1":50.0,"x2":210.0,"y2":50.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"k0","x":240.0,"y":40.0,"w":30.0,"h":26.0,"text":"1","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"k1","x":274.0,"y":40.0,"w":30.0,"h":26.0,"text":"2","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"k2","x":308.0,"y":40.0,"w":30.0,"h":26.0,"text":"3","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"k3","x":240.0,"y":72.0,"w":30.0,"h":26.0,"text":"4","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"k4","x":274.0,"y":72.0,"w":30.0,"h":26.0,"text":"5","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"k5","x":308.0,"y":72.0,"w":30.0,"h":26.0,"text":"6","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":124.0,"text":"the type stays text, only the keyboard changes","size":9.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"h1","x":190.0,"y":26.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"disabled","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"h2","x":300.0,"y":26.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"readonly","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"l0","x":62.0,"y":60.0,"w":106.0,"h":24.0,"text":"takes focus","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d0","x":190.0,"y":60.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"no","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"r0","x":300.0,"y":60.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"yes","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"l1","x":62.0,"y":92.0,"w":106.0,"h":24.0,"text":"sent in the request","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d1","x":190.0,"y":92.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"no","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"r1","x":300.0,"y":92.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"yes","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"l2","x":62.0,"y":124.0,"w":106.0,"h":24.0,"text":"can be edited","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d2","x":190.0,"y":124.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"no","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"r2","x":300.0,"y":124.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"no","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"t0","x":70.0,"y":36.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":"page loaded","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"t1","x":250.0,"y":36.0,"w":150.0,"h":28.0,"text":"person typed something","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a0","x1":70.0,"y1":52.0,"x2":70.0,"y2":80.0,"tone":"red","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"a1","x1":250.0,"y1":52.0,"x2":250.0,"y2":80.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":104.0,"w":110.0,"h":40.0,"text":":invalid\nred at once","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":250.0,"y":104.0,"w":150.0,"h":40.0,"text":":user-invalid\nwaits for input","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":156.0,"text":"an empty required field does not scare at the start","size":9.0}]],"cues":[10.3,19.2,33.4]}]},{"title":"ARIA in forms","sub":"describedby, invalid and tab order","main":"A hint and an error are linked by aria-describedby; tab order comes from the markup.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["describedby","aria-invalid","Tab order","tabindex"],"captions":["A hint is linked by aria-describedby to an id: the screen reader reads it after the field name","Validation fails: the field gets aria-invalid=true, and assistive technology reports the error","Tab follows the markup order, so do not break it with styles","tabindex=0 adds an element to the tab order, -1 gives focus only from code, positive values are not needed"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"code","x":20.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["<label for=\"pw\">Password</label>","<input id=\"pw\" type=\"password\"","       aria-describedby=\"hint\">","<p id=\"hint\">At least 8 characters</p>"],"hl":[2,3],"lang":"html","size":9.0,"lh":14.0,"w":320.0},{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":180.0,"y":118.0,"w":320.0,"h":34.0,"text":"screen reader: \"Password, edit text. At least 8 characters\"","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"code","x":20.0,"y":22.0,"lines":["<input id=\"pw\" aria-invalid=\"true\"","       aria-describedby=\"err\">","<p id=\"err\">Password shorter than 8 characters</p>"],"hl":[0],"lang":"html","size":9.0,"lh":15.0,"w":320.0},{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":180.0,"y":118.0,"w":320.0,"h":34.0,"text":"\"Password, invalid entry. Password is shorter than 8 characters\"","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"t1","x":60.0,"y":60.0,"w":70.0,"h":32.0,"text":"login","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"t2","x":180.0,"y":60.0,"w":70.0,"h":32.0,"text":"password","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"t3","x":300.0,"y":60.0,"w":70.0,"h":32.0,"text":"sign in","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":96.0,"y1":60.0,"x2":144.0,"y2":60.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":216.0,"y1":60.0,"x2":264.0,"y2":60.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":112.0,"text":"Tab follows the markup order, not the drawing","size":9.5},{"t":"text","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":138.0,"text":"change the order with markup, not styles","size":9.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"k0","x":60.0,"y":50.0,"w":100.0,"h":36.0,"text":"tabindex=0\nin the tab order","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"k1","x":180.0,"y":50.0,"w":100.0,"h":36.0,"text":"tabindex=-1\nscript only","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"k2","x":300.0,"y":50.0,"w":100.0,"h":36.0,"text":"tabindex>0\nnot needed","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":112.0,"text":"focus belongs on real elements: links, buttons, fields","size":9.5}]],"cues":[19.4,28.6,35.2]}]},{"title":"Error messages","sub":"Text, not just color","main":"An error is text next to the field: what happened and how to fix it; focus goes to the first error.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Color only","Text","Announce","Focus on the error"],"captions":["A red border is not a message: some people cannot tell colors apart, and a screen reader cannot hear it","A good message says what happened and how to fix it, and stands next to the field","It is linked to the field through describedby, and in a role=alert region it is announced at once","After a failed submit, focus goes to the first error or to a summary with links; do not erase the input"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"f","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":32.0,"text":"password","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"w1","x":265.0,"y":45.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"color-blind: cannot see it","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5,"dash":true},{"t":"cell","id":"w2","x":265.0,"y":80.0,"w":130.0,"h":26.0,"text":"reader: cannot hear","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5,"dash":true},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":135.0,"text":"a red border is not a message","size":9.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"f","x":180.0,"y":45.0,"w":200.0,"h":30.0,"text":"password","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"m","x":180.0,"y":92.0,"w":260.0,"h":28.0,"text":"Password shorter than 8 characters","tone":"outline","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5,"text_color":"var(--s-red)"},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":140.0,"text":"what happened and how to fix it","size":9.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"code","x":20.0,"y":28.0,"lines":["<input aria-describedby=\"err\">","<p id=\"err\" role=\"alert\">","  Password shorter than 8 characters","</p>"],"hl":[1],"lang":"html","size":9.5,"lh":16.0,"w":320.0},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":120.0,"text":"role=alert: announced as soon as it appears","size":9.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":60.0,"y":45.0,"w":90.0,"h":30.0,"text":"submit","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":45.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"there are errors","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":300.0,"y":45.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"focus on first","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":108.0,"y1":45.0,"x2":126.0,"y2":45.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":232.0,"y1":45.0,"x2":248.0,"y2":45.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":180.0,"y":105.0,"w":260.0,"h":28.0,"text":"summary with links to fields","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":150.0,"text":"do not erase the input","size":9.5}]],"cues":[11.2,18.9,26.4]}]},{"title":"Accessible form checklist","sub":"Bridge to forms in JavaScript","main":"An accessible form works without scripts: labels, types, groups, real buttons and clear errors.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels"